commit 37fe761b32a283c84cdf7b6084291c1d63471a6a
Author: Gautam Mahli <gautammahli08@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 3 00:36:59 2026 +0530

    Fix loop: make plan extraction deterministic and outlines stable
    
    Fix for fixloop/DECLARATION.md (repeatability gate):
    
    1. Determinism. Voxel and drift-observation sums are integer
       micrometres, so totals do not depend on worker completion order;
       fused points are returned in voxel-key order. The same capture now
       produces an identical plan (test: identical clouds with 1/3/8
       workers).
    2. Outline stabilisation. U-shaped outline features (notches, bumps,
       leak strips) shallower or narrower than 0.30 m are flattened before
       wall fitting.
    3. Drift prior search extended to stronger priors (x0.03..x8); the
       selection is no longer pinned to the old grid edge (x0.25).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

